  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension of Enset from Living Larder to Wealth Creation for Resilient High Land Communities in Wolaita Zone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christian Aid and SOS Sahel Ethiopia have been implementing RESET Plus Innovation project in Wolaita zone, Southern Ethiopia region with the financial support from the EU, through Cordaid. The implementation of the project, which has ended in May 2023, has been working with 1820 targets in two Woredas. The innovation project has organised 320 youth into 12 enset processing enterprises and manufacturing of fermentation jar. Due to various challenges including COVID and heavy market price inflation the project was not completed as planned to give proper coaching and technical support to the groups.
Thus, this project is designed with the aim to support the enterprises on areas of marking products (branding, promotion etc.), improving the quality of products and processing machineries in collaboration with local partners.</narrative>
  </description>
